            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, 'nvim-0.12' is planned to use `vim.pack` instead of 'mini.deps'. But only after there is a general suggestion to use `vim.pack` on Neovim>=0.12 instead of 'mini.deps'. I am not yet sure when this will happen: at least shortly after Neovim 0.12 release, but maybe sooner. So the initial version of nvim-0.12 will probably still use 'mini.deps'.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, 'nvim-0.12' is planned to use <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.pack</code> instead of 'mini.deps'. But only after there is a general suggestion to use <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.pack</code> on Neovim&gt;=0.12 instead of 'mini.deps'. I am not yet sure when this will happen: at least shortly after Neovim 0.12 release, but maybe sooner. So the initial version of nvim-0.12 will probably still use 'mini.deps'.</p>",
